# Keep Unix line endings everywhere: pi/ files are copied to the Pi and bash breaks on Windows
# line endings (Git for Windows converts them by default). The Pi software's version is also a
# fingerprint of these exact bytes, so Mac and Windows checkouts must match.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.icns binary
# Windows batch files want Windows line endings.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
